{"type":"text","timestamp":1794544384418,"sessionID":"ses_e2cd4f3cfffeelBSvDjDgyOLSn","part":{"id":"prt_1d32e2347002eM3u1WTgGkJfi1","sessionID":"ses_e2cd4f3cfffeelBSvDjDgyOLSn","messageID":"msg_1d32e0824001FTd8DEj6w8gO4o","type":"text","text":"T010 is done. The six aliases are in `sk-doc`, the hub was refreshed and all four `HUBOK` checks plus `BINT` pass.\n\nFiles written:\n\n1. `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/hub-router.json` — appended `\"agent definition\"` and `\"specialist persona file\"` to `create-agent-aliases`, `\"prompt shortcut\"` and `\"confirm flag\"` to `create-command-aliases`, `\"before and after my rewrite\"` to `create-diff-aliases`, `\"intent file\"` to `create-goal-aliases`. Nothing else changed.\n2. `.skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/sk-doc/manifest.json` — regenerated by `REFRESH sk-doc`.\n3. `specs/sk-doc/z_archive/019-skill-routing-refactor/015-router-unification-program/013-live-activation/activation/sk-doc/manifest.json` — authored twin, byte-identical copy.\n4. `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/012-plain-offer-reach/scratch/routes-sk-doc-after.tsv` — 154-line recapture.\n\nVerify output, all from the final state:\n\n```\n$ jq '[.vocabularyClasses[].keywords | length] | add' $HRD\n251\n(before the edit the same command printed 245)\n\n$ diff $SP/routes-sk-doc-before.tsv $SP/routes-sk-doc-after.tsv | rg '^>' | cut -f1 | tr '\\n' ' '\n> cmd-create-agent-plain-tune-01 > cmd-create-agent-plain-tune-02 > cmd-create-command-plain-tune-01 > cmd-create-diff-plain-tune-01 > cmd-create-goal-plain-tune-01\n\n$ rg -n 'sk-create-(agent|command|diff|goal)' $SP/routes-sk-doc-after.tsv | rg -c 'plain-tune'\n6\n\n$ node .skilled/bin/compiled-route-guard.cjs --json | jq .failures\n0\n```\n\n`HUBOK sk-doc` checks:\n\n```\n$ node .skilled/bin/compiled-route-manifest.cjs freshness --hub sk-doc --skill-root .skilled/skills/sk-doc | jq -r .causeCode\nfresh\n\n$ cmp $MS/sk-doc/manifest.json $MA/sk-doc/manifest.json\n(no output)\n\n$ node .skilled/bin/compiled-route-sync.cjs --check | tail -1\nall 55 served copies match their authored files\n\n$ node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/parent-skill-check.cjs .skilled/skills/sk-doc | tail -1\nOK: parent-skill-check — all hard invariants passed, 0 warnings\n```\n\n`BINT`:\n\n```\n$ node --test .skilled/bin/tests/compiled-route-*.test.cjs\nℹ tests 104\nℹ suites 6\nℹ pass 104\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\n```\n\nThe route diff named only the five expected ids, with no `mns-`, `nm-`, `sv-` or `canary:` row. The manifest diff is a one-line policy hash change. I did not tick the checkbox. Nothing failed and nothing was left undone. Known residual risk: none. The work is uncommitted, as required for a dispatched worker.","time":{"start":1794544378695,"end":1794544384418}}}
